# TLS 1.2 Benchmark

This directory contains benchmark outputs and experiments for TLS 1.2 handshakes using OpenSSL.

## Cipher Suite

```bash
ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256

Benchmark Command

openssl s_time -connect localhost:4433 -new -time 30 -tls1_2 -cipher ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256

Measured Metrics
connections per second
total handshakes
computational overhead
estimated RTT-adjusted latency
Notes

TLS 1.2 requires:

TCP handshake → 1 RTT
TLS handshake → 2 RTT

Total: 3 RTT
